<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - M. Stanley cuts Sun Micro. [CORRECTED 14:54 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - M. Stanley cuts Sun Micro. [CORRECTED 14:54 GMT]</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it cut Sun Microsystems Inc to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Steve Milunovich (corrects from Chuck Phillips)</p>
<p>was not immediately available to comment on the downgrade.</p>
<p>-- Sun Microsystems was off 7-1/8 at 62-7/8 shortly after the opening of trading Wednesday, following the release late Tuesday of its earnings report for the first fiscal quarter ended September.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
